{"page":582,"width":1737,"height":2609,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"14.7 복구 645","words":[{"text":"14.7","x":1274,"y":159,"width":70,"height":23},{"text":"복구","x":1360,"y":160,"width":46,"height":24},{"text":"645","x":1477,"y":156,"width":58,"height":30}]},{"text":"록에 기록한다. 트랜잭션이 완료되면 이 블록들의 구버전을 가리기고 있는 메타데이터","words":[{"text":"록에","x":305,"y":287,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"기록한다.","x":388,"y":287,"width":130,"height":37},{"text":"트랜잭션이","x":536,"y":287,"width":146,"height":37},{"text":"완료되면","x":699,"y":288,"width":116,"height":37},{"text":"이","x":832,"y":289,"width":24,"height":36},{"text":"블록들의","x":874,"y":288,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"구버전을","x":1013,"y":287,"width":124,"height":37},{"text":"가리기고","x":1153,"y":286,"width":126,"height":37},{"text":"있는","x":1296,"y":286,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"메타데이터","x":1375,"y":287,"width":156,"height":39}]},{"text":"구조가 새로운 블록들을 가리기도록 갱신된다. 그런 후에 파일 시스템은 구 포인터들과","words":[{"text":"구조가","x":306,"y":347,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"새로운","x":417,"y":347,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"블록들을","x":524,"y":347,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"가리기도록","x":659,"y":347,"width":145,"height":37},{"text":"갱신된다.","x":819,"y":347,"width":126,"height":37},{"text":"그런","x":961,"y":347,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"후에","x":1035,"y":348,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"파일","x":1110,"y":347,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"시스템은","x":1187,"y":347,"width":128,"height":37},{"text":"구","x":1328,"y":349,"width":32,"height":34},{"text":"포인터들과","x":1374,"y":347,"width":162,"height":39}]},{"text":"옛 블록들을 제기하여 재사용할 수 있게 만든다. 이전 포인터와 블록이 유지되면 스냅숏","words":[{"text":"옛","x":307,"y":406,"width":29,"height":36},{"text":"블록들을","x":351,"y":407,"width":128,"height":35},{"text":"제기하여","x":492,"y":406,"width":117,"height":37},{"text":"재사용할","x":626,"y":407,"width":116,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":754,"y":408,"width":28,"height":36},{"text":"있게","x":796,"y":408,"width":54,"height":36},{"text":"만든다.","x":866,"y":408,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"이전","x":979,"y":408,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"포인터와","x":1052,"y":408,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"블록이","x":1188,"y":408,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"유지되면","x":1296,"y":407,"width":128,"height":36},{"text":"스냅숏","x":1438,"y":409,"width":98,"height":37}]},{"text":"이 생성된다. 스냅숏은 특정 시점(해당 시점 이후의 업데이트가 적용되기 전)의 파일 시","words":[{"text":"이","x":308,"y":466,"width":27,"height":36},{"text":"생성된다.","x":352,"y":466,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"스냅숏은","x":501,"y":466,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"특정","x":635,"y":467,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"시점(해당","x":707,"y":467,"width":129,"height":39},{"text":"시점","x":849,"y":467,"width":55,"height":37},{"text":"이후의","x":922,"y":467,"width":88,"height":37},{"text":"업데이트가","x":1028,"y":467,"width":154,"height":37},{"text":"적용되기","x":1196,"y":467,"width":121,"height":37},{"text":"전)의","x":1337,"y":468,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"파일","x":1425,"y":469,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"시","x":1504,"y":470,"width":28,"height":36}]},{"text":"스템 상태이다. 이 해결 방안은 포인터 갱신이 자동으로 일어난다면 일관성 검사 필요 없게","words":[{"text":"스템","x":306,"y":526,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"상태이다.","x":381,"y":526,"width":129,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":523,"y":526,"width":25,"height":36},{"text":"해결","x":563,"y":527,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"방안은","x":633,"y":527,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"포인터","x":730,"y":528,"width":82,"height":35},{"text":"갱신이","x":828,"y":527,"width":82,"height":37},{"text":"자동으로","x":925,"y":528,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"일어난다면","x":1057,"y":528,"width":149,"height":35},{"text":"일관성","x":1220,"y":528,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"검사","x":1325,"y":528,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"필요","x":1398,"y":529,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"없게","x":1474,"y":529,"width":60,"height":37}]},{"text":"된다. 그러나 WAFL은 일관성 김사기를 가지고 있어서 몇몇 고장 시나리오는 메타데이","words":[{"text":"된다.","x":307,"y":586,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"그러나","x":393,"y":586,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"WAFL은","x":501,"y":587,"width":132,"height":35},{"text":"일관성","x":648,"y":587,"width":82,"height":36},{"text":"김사기를","x":748,"y":587,"width":116,"height":37},{"text":"가지고","x":878,"y":588,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"있어서","x":981,"y":588,"width":85,"height":36},{"text":"몇몇","x":1086,"y":588,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"고장","x":1158,"y":588,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"시나리오는","x":1234,"y":588,"width":158,"height":36},{"text":"메타데이","x":1406,"y":589,"width":126,"height":38}]},{"text":"터 오염을 초래할 수 있다. (이에 대한 자세한 사항에 대해서는 14.8절을 참조하라).","words":[{"text":"터","x":308,"y":647,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"오염을","x":350,"y":647,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"초래할","x":456,"y":646,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":558,"y":647,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":601,"y":646,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"(이에","x":677,"y":647,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"대한","x":757,"y":648,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"자세한","x":824,"y":648,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"사항에","x":924,"y":648,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"대해서는","x":1026,"y":648,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"14.8절을","x":1158,"y":648,"width":126,"height":35},{"text":"참조하라).","x":1295,"y":648,"width":145,"height":40}]},{"text":"ZFS는 디스크 일관성에 대해 더 혁신적인 접근 방법을 채택한다. ZFS는 WAFL와","words":[{"text":"ZFS는","x":366,"y":708,"width":98,"height":33},{"text":"디스크","x":478,"y":706,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"일관성에","x":583,"y":706,"width":116,"height":36},{"text":"대해","x":715,"y":707,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"더","x":788,"y":708,"width":23,"height":36},{"text":"혁신적인","x":829,"y":708,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"접근","x":963,"y":708,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"방법을","x":1034,"y":708,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"채택한다.","x":1139,"y":707,"width":131,"height":37},{"text":"ZFS는","x":1285,"y":712,"width":97,"height":32},{"text":"WAFL와","x":1394,"y":712,"width":142,"height":37}]},{"text":"마찬가지로 절대로 블록을 덮어쓰지 않는다. 그러나 ZFS는 한 발 더 나아가서 메타데이","words":[{"text":"마찬가지로","x":306,"y":767,"width":161,"height":36},{"text":"절대로","x":481,"y":766,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"블록을","x":583,"y":766,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"덮어쓰지","x":688,"y":767,"width":114,"height":36},{"text":"않는다.","x":819,"y":768,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"그러나","x":928,"y":768,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"ZFS는","x":1030,"y":770,"width":94,"height":33},{"text":"한","x":1135,"y":768,"width":32,"height":35},{"text":"발","x":1179,"y":768,"width":31,"height":36},{"text":"더","x":1222,"y":768,"width":26,"height":37},{"text":"나아가서","x":1265,"y":769,"width":123,"height":37},{"text":"메타데이","x":1405,"y":771,"width":125,"height":37}]},{"text":"터와 데이터 블록의 검사-총합을 제공한다. 이 해결책은 RAID와 결합될 때 데이터가","words":[{"text":"터와","x":308,"y":827,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"데이터","x":386,"y":827,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"블록의","x":493,"y":826,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"검사-총합을","x":602,"y":826,"width":176,"height":37},{"text":"제공한다.","x":793,"y":828,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":935,"y":828,"width":25,"height":35},{"text":"해결책은","x":978,"y":828,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"RAID와","x":1112,"y":829,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"결합될","x":1251,"y":829,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"때","x":1360,"y":830,"width":27,"height":36},{"text":"데이터가","x":1407,"y":830,"width":129,"height":38}]},{"text":"항상 올바르다는 것을 보장한다. 따라서 ZFS는 일관성 검사기가 없다. ZFS의 자세한 사","words":[{"text":"항상","x":305,"y":888,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"올바르다는","x":381,"y":887,"width":160,"height":36},{"text":"것을","x":553,"y":887,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"보장한다.","x":624,"y":887,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"따라서","x":764,"y":888,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"ZFS는","x":865,"y":890,"width":92,"height":33},{"text":"일관성","x":970,"y":888,"width":85,"height":36},{"text":"검사기가","x":1071,"y":888,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"없다.","x":1206,"y":889,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"ZFS의","x":1287,"y":890,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"자세한","x":1395,"y":890,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"사","x":1503,"y":892,"width":33,"height":36}]},{"text":"항은 11.8.6절에 나와 있다.","words":[{"text":"항은","x":305,"y":948,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"11.8.6절에","x":382,"y":947,"width":149,"height":35},{"text":"나와","x":546,"y":947,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":621,"y":947,"width":64,"height":37}]},{"text":"14.7.4 백업과 복구 Backup and Restore","words":[{"text":"14.7.4","x":305,"y":1060,"width":142,"height":30},{"text":"백업과","x":488,"y":1059,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"복구","x":585,"y":1060,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"Backup","x":667,"y":1070,"width":107,"height":26},{"text":"and","x":783,"y":1071,"width":53,"height":21},{"text":"Restore","x":844,"y":1071,"width":112,"height":21}]},{"text":"저장장치 고장은 데이터를 잃어버리게 할 수 있으므로 자료가 영원히 손실되지 않도록","words":[{"text":"저장장치","x":307,"y":1133,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"고장은","x":449,"y":1133,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"데이터를","x":559,"y":1134,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"잃어버리게","x":698,"y":1135,"width":148,"height":37},{"text":"할","x":862,"y":1136,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":906,"y":1136,"width":31,"height":36},{"text":"있으므로","x":952,"y":1136,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"자료가","x":1086,"y":1136,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"영원히","x":1194,"y":1136,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"손실되지","x":1299,"y":1134,"width":124,"height":37},{"text":"않도록","x":1443,"y":1134,"width":96,"height":36}]},{"text":"보장해 줄 필요가 있다. 이 때문에, 시스템 프로그램들은 하나의 보조저장장치의 내용을","words":[{"text":"보장해","x":305,"y":1193,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"줄","x":415,"y":1195,"width":32,"height":34},{"text":"필요가","x":461,"y":1194,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":569,"y":1195,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":652,"y":1195,"width":25,"height":36},{"text":"때문에,","x":694,"y":1195,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"시스템","x":807,"y":1196,"width":87,"height":36},{"text":"프로그램들은","x":909,"y":1196,"width":185,"height":35},{"text":"하나의","x":1104,"y":1196,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"보조저장장치의","x":1209,"y":1195,"width":218,"height":37},{"text":"내용을","x":1444,"y":11